#: /home/cvs/prod/branches/KDE/4.2/kdebase/runtime/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:155
msgctxt "Name"
msgid ""
"The application %progname (%appname) crashed and caused the signal %signum (%"
"signame)."
msgstr ""
"अनुप्रयोग %progname (%appname) क्रॅश झाले व संकेत %signum (%signame) निर्माण करण्यास "
"कारणीभूत ठरले."

#: /home/cvs/prod/branches/KDE/4.2/kdebase/runtime/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:230
msgctxt "Name"
msgid ""
"Please help us improve the software you use by filing a report at <a href="
"\"http://bugs.kde.org\">http://bugs.kde.org</a>. Useful details include how "
"to reproduce the error, documents that were loaded, etc."
msgstr ""
" <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org\">http://bugs.kde.org</a> येथे अहवाल सादर करून "
"कृपया सॉफ्टवेअर सुधारीत करण्यास मदत करा. वापरण्याजोगी माहिती अंतर्गत त्रुटी कशी "
"दर्शवायची, दाखलकरण्याजोगी दस्तऐवज, इत्यादी समाविष्टीत आहे."

#: /home/cvs/prod/branches/KDE/4.2/kdebase/runtime/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:297
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"An application mostly receives the SIGILL signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"अनुप्रयोग अंतर्गत बग असल्यास अनुप्रयोग सहसा SIGILL संकेत प्राप्त करतो. अनुप्रयोगला दस्तऐवज "
"संचयीत करण्यास विनंतीकृत केले गेले आहे."

#: /home/cvs/prod/branches/KDE/4.2/kdebase/runtime/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:373
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"An application terminates with a SIGABRT signal when it detects an internal "
"inconsistency caused by a bug in the program."
msgstr ""
"कार्यक्रमातील बगमुळे आंतरीक अस्थीरता आढळल्यास अनुप्रयोग त्यास SIGABRT संकेतसह समाप्त करतो."

#: /home/cvs/prod/branches/KDE/4.2/kdebase/runtime/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:447
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"An application mostly receives the SIGFPE signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"अनुप्रोयग अंतर्गत बगमुळे अनुप्रयोग सहसा SIGFPE संकेत प्राप्त करतो. अनुप्रयोगला दस्तऐवज "
"संचयीत करण्यास विनंतीकृत केले गेले आहे."

#: /home/cvs/prod/branches/KDE/4.2/kdebase/runtime/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:523
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"An application mostly receives the SIGSEGV signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""

#: /home/cvs/prod/branches/KDE/4.2/kdebase/runtime/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:671
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Sorry, I do not know this signal."
msgstr "माफ करा, हे संकेत माहित नाही."

